							</p>
							<p class="technologies-item-text-desc">
								Sustainability is a core value that Samsung cherishes and is committed to at both a corporate and business level. Samsung is constantly working to enable sustainable network operations for our customers.
							</p>
							<div class="btn-wrap">
								<a href="/global/business/networks/technologies/ran-energy-saving/" class="technologies-item-btn dark-bg" data-an-tr="body contents" data-an-ca="link click" data-an-ac="learn more" data-an-la="automotive">Learn more</a>
