							</p>
							<p class="technologies-item-text-desc">
								5G is a game changer that will completely shift the paradigm of mobile communication and industries alike.
							</p>
							<div class="btn-wrap">
								<a href="/global/business/networks/solutions/network-slicing/" class="technologies-item-btn dark-bg" data-an-tr="body contents" data-an-ca="link click" data-an-ac="learn more" data-an-la="automotive">Learn more</a>
