						</figure>
					</div>

					
					<div class="technologies-item-con">
						<div class="technologies-item-text">
							<p class="technologies-item-title">
								Tapping<br/>into Industry 4.0
							</p>
							<p class="technologies-item-text-desc">
								With the rise of diversified technologies and applications, the market’s expectation of Industry 4.0 is becoming a reality. To power new, innovative services, many enterprises and organizations are adopting powerful yet secure private networks in their workplaces.
							</p>
							<div class="btn-wrap">
								<a href="/global/business/networks/solutions/private-networks/" class="technologies-item-btn dark-bg" data-an-tr="body contents" data-an-ca="link click" data-an-ac="learn more" data-an-la="automotive">Learn more</a>
